  "summary": {
    "ja": "2次元対数核のM2M・M2L・L2Lを持つFMM: 自由空間の対数ポテンシャルを一様四分木の多重極・局所展開で評価し、直接和と比較します。 FMM：直接和・解析配置と展開次数・木の深さ: 96粒子の2次元対数核を別の全対直接和と照合し、展開次数・木の深さ、回転・平行移動、合力の近似誤差を測ります。",
    "en": "2D logarithmic FMM with M2M, M2L and L2L: Evaluate a free-space log potential with uniform-quadtree multipole and local expansions and compare with direct sums. FMM: direct and analytic references, order and tree depth: Compare a 96-particle 2D logarithmic kernel with independent all-pairs sums; measure order/depth, rotation/translation and approximate net-force errors."
  },
